# Cocoa — cloud agent handoff

Build the approved **Cocoa** life-quote set. Do not invent a second brief. Do not change the type recipe. Do not start Angle 2 living-room or kids.

## Suggested skills

- Fetch the Notion page first (workspace rule)
- `recreating-typography` only if you must restate the locked recipe — do not redesign
- `verification-before-completion` after renders

## Brief

**Notion:** https://app.notion.com/p/3ca67992bfc981e5a4b3d41d93f2c8eb

This job is a **volume** lane next to the locked 5+5+5 curated angles. One look. Twenty lines. NahaPrints listing model: **one design × five sizes**. Buyer file = clean type only. No room mockups in the PNG.

**Do not list:** These are the good old days. CIAO. Do not reuse M01–M05 or L01–L05 copy.

## Locked look — Cocoa (D11)

Reference (must match):

- `cocoa/references/D11_packed-cocoa.png` (M01, the approved brown)
- `cocoa/references/D11_m02-remember-why.png`

Recipe — do not drift:

- Paper `#352418`
- Ink `#E8D5B8`
- Face: Abril Fatface, all-caps, tight leading (~0.78), tracking about `-0.03em`
- Centered lockup, 2–3 lines, no second font, no box, no hairline, no outline, no photo
- Source of truth: `.d11` in `cocoa/template.html`

D12 Clay is a sister system. **Do not use it on this set.**

## Approved copy — do not rewrite

Stacks live in `cocoa/prints.json`. Build all 20.

| ID | Line | Stack |
