| C01 | Collect moments not things | Collect / moments / not things |
| C02 | Be where your feet are | Be where / your feet / are |
| C03 | This too shall pass | This too / shall pass |
| C04 | You are enough | You are / enough |
| C05 | Make it a good day | Make it / a good day |
| C06 | The best is yet to come | The best / is yet / to come |
| C07 | Grow through what you go through | Grow through / what you / go through |
| C08 | Progress over perfection | Progress / over / perfection |
| C09 | Choose your hard | Choose / your hard |
| C10 | Life is happening now | Life is / happening / now |
| C11 | Become who you needed | Become / who you / needed |
| C12 | Less hurry more life | Less hurry / more life |
| C13 | One day at a time | One day / at a time |
| C14 | You get to begin again | You get / to begin / again |
| C15 | Let it be enough | Let it / be enough |
| C16 | Start where you are | Start / where you are |
| C17 | Keep going anyway | Keep going / anyway |
| C18 | Better things ahead | Better / things / ahead |
| C19 | Do it scared | Do it / scared |
| C20 | Nothing is wasted | Nothing / is wasted |

C07 ships with `displaySize: 156`. The generator also auto-shrinks if a line overflows.

## How to build

```bash
npm install
npx playwright install chromium
node cocoa/generate.mjs
node cocoa/generate.mjs --sizes
```

Single print: `node cocoa/generate.mjs --print C07`

Outputs:

- `output/cocoa/prints/<ID>/2x3/<ID>_<slug>__2x3.png` (then 4x5, 5x7, 11x14, ISO)
- `output/cocoa/prints/cocoa-board.png` after the 2x3 pass

Ratios (stage 1500px wide, deviceScaleFactor 3 → 300 DPI):

- 2x3 1500×2250
- 4x5 1500×1875
- 5x7 1500×2100
- 11x14 1500×1909
- ISO 1500×2121

## QA before you stop

1. Open `output/cocoa/prints/cocoa-board.png` and every 2x3.
2. Compare C01–C20 to `cocoa/references/D11_packed-cocoa.png` — same brown, same face, same density.
3. No cropped letters. Auto-fit should have caught C07 / C01 / C06.
4. Then run `--sizes` and spot-check C01, C07, C13 on 4x5 and ISO.

## Stop here

- Do not invent new lines
- Do not switch fonts or add a second voice
- Do not cut living-room L01–L05 or kids K01–K05
- Do not put room mockups in the buyer files
- Do not create the Etsy listing
- Commit the generator/JSON/handoff if you change them; `output/` is gitignored — leave renders in the workspace

## If something breaks

- Fonts: wait for `document.fonts.ready` (already in the script). Need network for Google Fonts.
- Playwright missing: `npx playwright install chromium`
- Overflow: lower `displaySize` on that row in `cocoa/prints.json` and re-run `--print Cxx`
